  "note": "IPA 761 = IPA 760 + RPCS3 Core 941 (the heat lot of the IPA 760 logs, maintainer 16 Nov 2026: the phone must stay in the nominal thermal state): REWINDBOX_LIGHT_LOAD_941 (while a game is light its PPU, SPU and RSX threads run in the utility class, on the efficiency cores, and take their own classes back within one 500 ms sample when the load or the frame rate says so) and REWINDBOX_RSX_IDLE_941 (the idle RSX park slice follows the idle time; the grace period waits on the PUT line in every thermal state once the wait is known to rest the core). Codegen identities unchanged. MeloNX, S2Arm, XeniaCore, the application and every retained component are those of the base. Images that must change: libRPCS3Core.dylib and Runner. Build-only delivery: Flutter/native groups not-run. Nothing has run on an iPhone; no heat, energy or FPS claim.",
